## Rolloutowo · Field

**Rolloutowo** = environment for deployment readiness — the model’s boundary before **Field**.

True validation occurs exclusively outside the model, in **Field**.
Work is incomplete until field validation is defined.

FIELD returns results as new **observations** (evolvability loop in **core.mdc**).

Optional intuition (docs only): breathing cycle — [`docs/identity/babcia-os-v1.md`](../../docs/identity/babcia-os-v1.md)

